<title>USA: Comprehensive Environmental names new CEO.</title>
<headline>Comprehensive Environmental names new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WEST BABYLON, N.Y. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comprehensive Environmental Systems Inc said Wednesday it has named Michael O'Reilly president, chief executive and sole director of the company.</p>
<p>O'Reilly will continue to serve as president of the company's principal subsidiary, Trade-Winds Environmental Restoration Inc, the company said.</p>
<p>He succeeds Donald Kessler, who was president and chief executive until resigning September 12.</p>
</text>
